  "description": "For Min Hye Kyung, every day is the same. She works, she takes the same train home, and she waits for her boyfriend to finally get in touch. But when she runs into a familiar face from her childhood, she realizes she's missing something. Now, if only she can figure out what it is, or how she is supposed to get it.\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
